---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import ConsultationCTA from '../components/ConsultationCTA.astro';
import { treatments } from '../data/treatments';
---
<BaseLayout title="Braces, Clear Aligners & Retainers | Hoffman Family Orthodontics" description="Explore metal and ceramic braces, Invisalign and Angel Aligners, and retainers with Dr. Rachel Hoffman in East Memphis.">
  <main id="main" class="interior-page">
    <section class="treatments-intro" aria-labelledby="treatments-title"><div class="container"><div class="page-title-row"><div><p class="eyebrow">Orthodontic treatments</p><h1 id="treatments-title">Different options.<br>Care that’s <em>yours.</em></h1></div><p class="page-intro-copy">Braces, clear aligners, and ongoing care for children, teens, and adults. Dr. Rachel Hoffman will help you understand which approach fits your smile.</p></div><nav class="page-jump-links" aria-label="Treatment sections"><a href="#braces">Braces</a><a href="#clear-aligners">Clear aligners</a><a href="#all-ages">All ages</a><a href="#retainers">Retainers</a><a href="#technology">Technology</a></nav></div></section>
    <section class="treatment-directory-section"><div class="container"><h2 class="directory-title">Explore a treatment</h2><nav class="treatment-directory" aria-label="Treatment guides">{treatments.map(treatment => <a href={`/treatments/${treatment.slug}/`}>{treatment.name}<span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>)}</nav></div></section>
    <section class="section" id="braces" aria-labelledby="braces-title"><div class="container treatment-feature"><div class="treatment-feature-image"><img src="/assets/treatment-options.webp" alt="A smiling woman with braces holding a clear orthodontic appliance" width="1000" height="667" fetchpriority="high"></div><div class="reading-copy"><p class="section-kicker">01 / Braces</p><h2 id="braces-title">Small adjustments.<br>Personal care.</h2><p>Braces guide your teeth into alignment through controlled, gradual movement. We offer two types, with a treatment plan tailored to you.</p><div class="treatment-description"><h3>Metal braces</h3><p>Stainless-steel brackets offer a durable, reliable option for children, teens, and adults. Modern metal braces are smaller and more comfortable than earlier designs.</p></div><div class="treatment-description"><h3>Ceramic braces</h3><p>Clear or tooth-colored ceramic brackets blend with your teeth for a less noticeable appearance while providing precise tooth movement.</p></div></div></div></section>
    <section class="section ice-section" id="clear-aligners" aria-labelledby="aligners-title"><div class="container editorial-grid"><div><p class="section-kicker">02 / Clear aligners</p><h2 id="aligners-title">A clear option<br>for your smile.</h2><p class="treatment-brands">Invisalign® &amp; Angel Aligners</p></div><div class="reading-copy"><p class="intro-lead">Removable aligners let you straighten your teeth without metal brackets.</p><p>Dr. Rachel creates a custom treatment plan using a series of clear aligners that gradually move your teeth. Because the aligners are removable, you can take them out for meals, brushing, and flossing.</p><p>At your consultation, we’ll discuss whether clear aligners are a good fit for your needs and what your daily routine during treatment would involve.</p><a class="text-link" href="/contact/#form">Talk through your options</a></div></div></section>
    <section class="section" id="all-ages" aria-labelledby="ages-title"><div class="container"><div class="section-heading"><h2 id="ages-title">For growing smiles.<br>And grown-up ones.</h2><p>Orthodontic care looks different at different stages of life. Your plan should reflect that.</p></div><div class="age-list"><article><h3>Children</h3><p>Evaluations can begin at age seven. When appropriate, early treatment helps guide jaw development and the eruption of permanent teeth.</p></article><article><h3>Teenagers</h3><p>Braces and clear aligners can address alignment and bite concerns as teens grow. We’ll help your family understand the available options.</p></article><article><h3>Adults</h3><p>We provide personalized treatment for adults who want to address tooth alignment, bite concerns, or changes in their smile.</p></article></div></div></section>
    <section class="section pale-section" id="retainers" aria-labelledby="retainers-title"><div class="container editorial-grid"><div><p class="section-kicker">03 / Retainers &amp; maintenance</p><h2 id="retainers-title">Care continues<br>after treatment.</h2></div><div class="reading-copy"><p class="intro-lead">Retainers help keep your teeth in their new positions.</p><p>Dr. Rachel will provide a custom retainer, instructions for wearing and caring for it, and a schedule for follow-up visits. Consistent wear is an important part of maintaining your results.</p><a class="text-link" href="/faq/#after-treatment">Read about retainer wear</a></div></div></section>
    <section class="section" id="technology" aria-labelledby="technology-title"><div class="container technology-grid"><div class="reading-copy"><h2 id="technology-title">A closer look.<br>A clearer plan.</h2><p>Photographs, digital scans, and X-rays give Dr. Rachel a detailed view of your teeth and bite. Together with your orthodontic exam, they help inform your treatment plan.</p><a class="text-link" href="/new-patients/">See what happens at your first visit</a></div><img src="/assets/consultation.webp" alt="An orthodontic consultation using a dental model to explain treatment" width="1000" height="667" loading="lazy"></div></section>
    <ConsultationCTA title="Let’s find your fit." />
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
